OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Kane's former Millwall team
OL,4,Amate 'so pleased'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former club captain of Millwall who
OL,7,Fplayed in the same team as Harry Kane
OL,8,Fhas expressed his joy after the England
OL,9,Fstriker won the Ballon d'Or.
OL,11,FAlan Dunne, who played with Kane at
OL,12,FMillwall in 2012 when he was on loan at
OL,13,Fthe south London club, said he was "so
OL,14,Fpleased to see him pick up such a
OL,15,Fprestigious award".
OL,17,FDunne, who is now manages Kent side
OL,18,FTonbridge Angels in the sixth tier of
OL,19,FEnglish football, said: "I feel
OL,20,Fhonoured to have shared a changing room
OL,21,Fwith him.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
