OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Kane's former Millwall team
OL,4,Amate 'so pleased'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think a lot of Millwall fans, ex
OL,7,Fplayers and coaches would all think he
OL,8,Fdeserves it, so I am delighted for
OL,9,Fhim."
